      "writtenOn": "2026-10-16T19:25:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Taken as a cleanup rather than a bug: with the shipped conf/plugins.yml the `arista` section exists, and `PluginManager` only loads plugins listed in that same file, so the `KeyError` needs a hand-edited config.\n\nThe driver now takes `username` in its constructor and the plugin passes `self.username` at all five call sites, matching `SSHHelper`; `Config` is no longer imported by the driver. external/juniper.py:26 has the same pattern but is not part of this change, so I left it alone; happy to do both in a follow-up.",
